WEBVTT

NOTE Openland performance lyric track (en). Timing aligned to this video.

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:31.480
照片泛黄 旧歌弹响
The photographs have yellowed, an old song rings out

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:36.640
是我们 绚烂的 过往
It is our brilliant past

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:43.780
人来人往 聚散无常
People come and go; meeting and parting have no certainty

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:49.140
是生活 无奈的 走向
That is the helpless way life goes

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:54.420
人 生 是场流浪
Life is a wandering

00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:57.560
没 人 总守望
No one keeps watch forever

00:00:57.720 --> 00:01:00.340
无奈的幻想
Helpless fantasies

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:06.560
离 别 难免惆怅
Parting can’t help but bring melancholy

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:09.560
就 让 这时光
Then just let this time

00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:12.320
轻轻的原谅
Forgive us, gently

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:02.800
a yi ya la

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:07.120
Yi ya la

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:14.320
Yi ya a la

00:02:14.320 --> 00:02:20.180
别感伤
Don’t linger in sorrow

00:02:20.180 --> 00:02:23.400
a yi ya la

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:25.200
Yi ya la

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:27.020
Yi ya a la

00:02:27.020 --> 00:02:30.040
人总要成长
We all have to grow

00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:25.980
照片泛黄 旧歌弹响
The photographs have yellowed, an old song rings out

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:30.660
是我们 绚烂的 过往
It is our brilliant past

00:03:32.370 --> 00:03:38.530
人来人往 聚散匆忙
People come and go; we gather and scatter in haste

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:43.240
要接受 命运的无常
We have to accept the inconstancy of fate

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:48.980
人 生 是场远航
Life is a long voyage

00:03:48.980 --> 00:03:52.180
各 自 有方向
Each of us has our own course

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:54.960
能并肩同往
To walk side by side

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:58.120
一程已足够珍藏
Even one stretch of the journey is already worth keeping

00:03:58.120 --> 00:04:01.740
离 别 难免惆怅
Parting can’t help but bring melancholy

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:05.060
但 有这时光
But we have this time

00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:07.700
能一起回想
That we can look back on together

00:04:07.820 --> 00:04:10.500
也不枉 这趟
And this journey won’t have been in vain

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:14.500
a yi ya la

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:17.760
Yi ya la

00:04:17.760 --> 00:04:21.080
Yi ya a la

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:24.500
前进吧
Go forward

00:04:27.460 --> 00:04:30.460
a yi ya la

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:33.560
Yi ya la

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:36.040
Yi ya a la

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:48.340
回忆化成光
Memories turn into light

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:57.900
回忆化成光
Memories turn into light

00:04:57.900 --> 00:05:01.160
照亮我前方
And light the way ahead of me

